et's be carried by life, in this world so grand"}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "Life's too short to be bridled, to be confined"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "So let's follow our desires, let the unexpected unwind"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "In this dance of chance, let's not be confined"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Keep options open, until the last moment defined"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}